Regularized logistic regression was implemented using the implementation provided by scikit-learn, with an l1 penalty55. Solving was performed with the Stochastic Average Gradient (SAGA) solver56, a maximum iteration number of 5,000 and tolerance of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
